{"steam_appid":4580600,"steam_name":"Animaly Bar: NO HUMANITY!","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4580600/2028143614/797c4a3239f21861e14e5aec86d54d0660444f93/1789323917/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1789324240","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257423361/5a32c5fca06f06f8de24de60367a4e6aa4ecbb90/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1789324240","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/9432a680cc5c524e8bc521323673f194e7e6d321/ss_9432a680cc5c524e8bc521323673f194e7e6d321.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789892509","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/de0490454d1db0911b29c6409d6037524a3483d5/ss_de0490454d1db0911b29c6409d6037524a3483d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789892509","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/add6e1d6244868fac84f462f116705256b91338b/ss_add6e1d6244868fac84f462f116705256b91338b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789892509","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/a5defbb8b2a5f74236e0b85856d460d5df839d45/ss_a5defbb8b2a5f74236e0b85856d460d5df839d45.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789892509","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/10aef53af27a0222bccc2ceafc650ac65f2be4fe/ss_10aef53af27a0222bccc2ceafc650ac65f2be4fe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789892509"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/f88390b40ebf8b11a82d976fc0f30bcc.poster.avif?t=1789892509\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/f88390b40ebf8b11a82d976fc0f30bcc.webm?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/f88390b40ebf8b11a82d976fc0f30bcc.mp4?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO ANIMALY BAR!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After animals won the war against humans, the world is now under their control. As a gorilla bartender at Animaly Bar, prepare drinks, carefully observe customers, and analyze their behavior. Because some of them may be humans in disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify the suspects, wait for the right moment, and eliminate them. But be careful… choosing the wrong target or letting too many humans slip away can lead to serious consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your bar against nightly invasions, maintain order, and survive. In Animaly Bar, no one is as they seem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Identify. Decide. Eliminate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Carefully examine incoming customers. Some may be humans in disguise. If you suspect one, shoot… but don’t make a mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/4cf0d077aeeece9e5f5f27d7c35a3db4.poster.avif?t=1789892509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/4cf0d077aeeece9e5f5f27d7c35a3db4.webm?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/4cf0d077aeeece9e5f5f27d7c35a3db4.mp4?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run the Bar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect stools, clean the floors, take out the trash, and restock drinks. Manage all the daily tasks of a real bar yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/4d26a3ed0a7b2f3f487c3ad0500f1882.poster.avif?t=1789892509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/4d26a3ed0a7b2f3f487c3ad0500f1882.webm?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/4d26a3ed0a7b2f3f487c3ad0500f1882.mp4?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Prepare Orders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow the given recipes to prepare drinks and serve orders completely and accurately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/bc2878a7e47536fe4bcb5174fe22a8ec.poster.avif?t=1789892509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/bc2878a7e47536fe4bcb5174fe22a8ec.webm?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/bc2878a7e47536fe4bcb5174fe22a8ec.mp4?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Defend Your Bar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On some nights, humans wearing animal costumes attack your bar. Stop anyone who gets inside and don’t let anything be taken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/f94645e76a8755a9592da4c1ff104f7e.poster.avif?t=1789892509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/f94645e76a8755a9592da4c1ff104f7e.webm?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/f94645e76a8755a9592da4c1ff104f7e.mp4?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fear-Filled Moments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face the creature that haunts the bar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/929c3f0b1cc055b06684acef6118b1ff.poster.avif?t=1789892509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/929c3f0b1cc055b06684acef6118b1ff.webm?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580600/extras/929c3f0b1cc055b06684acef6118b1ff.mp4?t=1789892509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Identify Suspects</strong> <br>Carefully analyze humans hiding among animals and make the right decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Bar</strong> <br>Control all daily tasks from cleaning to inventory management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow Recipes</strong> <br>Prepare drinks using the correct recipes to fulfill orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Against Invasions</strong> <br>Some nights your bar is attacked. Stop intruders and protect your supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Have Consequences</strong> <br>Wrong decisions can lead to financial loss and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1.5–2 Hours of Gameplay</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050ti or AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7-8700K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Domnaier"],"publishers":["Domnaier"],"release_date":"Sep 13, 2026"}